@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:1198
@apiKey = replace-with-your-generated-api-key

### Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/


### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/health


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### SYSTEM NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Create Immediate System Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Welcome",
    "message": "Welcome to the notification service.",
    "priority": "normal"
}


### Create High Priority System Notification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Important Update",
    "message": "A high priority system notification.",
    "priority": "high"
}


### Create Scheduled System Notification
### Change scheduledAt to a future ISO date/time before testing
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Scheduled Reminder",
    "message": "This notification should be delivered when scheduled processing runs.",
    "priority": "normal",
    "scheduledAt": "2026-08-18T10:00:00.000Z"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### EMAIL NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Create Immediate Email Notification
### Requires valid SMTP values in .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "email",
    "recipient": "recipient@example.com",
    "subject": "Email Notification Test",
    "message": "This is a plain-text email notification.",
    "priority": "normal"
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fc8bff5d40b70c012775/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Create HTML Email Notification
### Requires valid SMTP values in .env
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "email",
    "recipient": "recipient@example.com",
    "subject": "HTML Notification Test",
    "message": "This is the plain-text fallback message.",
    "html": "<h1>Notification Service</h1><p>This is an HTML email notification.</p>",
    "priority": "high"
}


### Create Scheduled Email Notification
### Requires valid SMTP values when scheduled processing runs
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "email",
    "recipient": "recipient@example.com",
    "subject": "Scheduled Email",
    "message": "This email is scheduled for later delivery.",
    "priority": "normal",
    "scheduledAt": "2026-08-18T10:30:00.000Z"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### BULK NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Create Bulk Notifications
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "notifications": [
        {
            "type": "system",
            "recipient": "user-001",
            "subject": "Bulk Notification One",
            "message": "First bulk notification.",
            "priority": "normal"
        },
        {
            "type": "system",
            "recipient": "user-002",
            "subject": "Bulk Notification Two",
            "message": "Second bulk notification.",
            "priority": "high"
        },
        {
            "type": "system",
            "recipient": "user-003",
            "subject": "Bulk Notification Three",
            "message": "Third bulk notification.",
            "priority": "low"
        }
    ]
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### HISTORY
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get All Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Search Subject Or Message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?search=welcome
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Filter By Recipient
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?recipient=user-001
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Filter By Type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?type=system
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Filter By Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?status=sent
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Filter By Priority
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Filter Unread Notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?isRead=false
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Sort By Created Date Ascending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?sort=createdAt&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Sort By Created Date Descending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?sort=createdAt&order=desc
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Combined Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?recipient=user-001&type=system&status=sent&priority=normal&isRead=false&sort=createdAt&order=desc&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### SINGLE NOTIFICATION
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Get Notification By ID
### Replace NOTIFICATION_ID with a real MongoDB notification ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fe95ff5d40b70c012778
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### READ / UNREAD
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Mark Notification As Read
### Replace NOTIFICATION_ID with a real MongoDB notification ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fe95ff5d40b70c012778/read
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Mark Notification As Unread
### Replace NOTIFICATION_ID with a real MongoDB notification ID
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fe95ff5d40b70c012778/unread
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Mark All Notifications For Recipient As Read
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "recipient": "user-001"
}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### SCHEDULED NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Process Due Scheduled Notifications
### Only scheduled notifications whose scheduledAt is now or earlier are processed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/process-scheduled
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### RETRY FAILED NOTIFICATION
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Retry Failed Notification
### Replace NOTIFICATION_ID with an ID whose status is failed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fe95ff5d40b70c012778/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### DELETE
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Delete Notification
### Replace NOTIFICATION_ID with a real MongoDB notification ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/6a82fe95ff5d40b70c012778
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### ---------------------------------------------------------
### VALIDATION / ERROR TESTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------

### Invalid Notification ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/invalid-id
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Missing Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system"
}


### Invalid Notification Type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "sms",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Invalid Type",
    "message": "SMS is not supported in this project."
}


### Invalid Email Recipient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "email",
    "recipient": "invalid-email",
    "subject": "Invalid Email",
    "message": "This request should fail validation."
}


### Invalid Priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Invalid Priority",
    "message": "This request should fail validation.",
    "priority": "urgent"
}


### Scheduled Date In The Past
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "type": "system",
    "recipient": "user-001",
    "subject": "Past Scheduled Notification",
    "message": "This request should fail because scheduledAt is in the past.",
    "scheduledAt": "2025-01-01T10:00:00.000Z"
}


### Empty Bulk Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "notifications": []
}


### Invalid Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications?page=0&limit=500&status=invalid
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}


### Mark All Read Without Recipient
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications/mark-all-read
Authorization: Bearer {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}


### Invalid Route
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/not-found
